  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The following strings should be modified for comprehension matter. \n\n\"Minimum Avatar Performance\" - 141163\n\n\"Change the minimum required avatar performance level for this instance\" - 141161\n\n\"Your avatar does not meet the minimum performance rank required for this instance.\" - 141153\n\n\"Minimum rank allowed:\" - 141151\n\nThe word \"minimum\" should be replaced by \"maximum\", as the feature prevent the avatar from being shown if the performance rank is ABOVE the one chosen. \n\n\"Minimum\" would mean that avatars with the performance rank of \"Medium\" joining a Performance Gated instance set as \"Worse\" would technically not be shown.",
